+// coop-eventslots (11-11, from pt1111d: two players' box and gate messages overwrote each other in the one message): the system
+// message's state as ranges, for each player's own slot (port/src/coop/coop_eventslots.cpp).
+void SysMesStateRanges(void (*add)(void *at, std::size_t bytes, const char *name, void *context), void *context) {
